Hi Dominik,

Just to add to the others' comments, looks like you have data collected using the European Seabirds at Sea protocol or something similar. If that's the case, distances to birds detected on the water would have been binned at the time of collection into into the flowing four distance bands: 0-50, 50-100, 100-200, 200-300 m. As Eric says, that means that you're limited to detection functions with four parameters or less.

All the best,

Ewan

